That sends the frozen-ground-swell under it,
And spills the upper boulders in the sun;
And makes gaps even two can pass abreast.
The work of hunters is another thing:
I have come after them and made repair
Where they have left not one stone on a stone,
But they would have the rabbit out of hiding,
To please the yelping dogs. The gaps I mean,
No one has seen them made or heard them made,
But at spring mending-time we find them there.
I let my neighbor know beyond the hill;
And on a day we meet to walk the line
And set the wall between us once again.
We keep the wall between us as we go.
To each the boulders that have fallen to each.
And some are loaves and some so nearly balls
We have to use a spell to make them balance:
\u2018Stay where you are until our backs are turned!\u2019
We wear our fingers rough with handling them.
Oh, just another kind of out-door game,
One on a side. It comes to little more:
There where it is we do not need the wall:
He is all pine and I am apple orchard.
My apple trees will never get across
And eat the cones under his pines, I tell him.
He only says, \u2018Good fences make good neighbors.\u2019
Spring is the mischief in me, and I wonder
If I could put a notion in his head:
\u2018Why do they make good neighbors? Isn't it
Where there are cows? But here there are no cows.
Before I built a wall I'd ask to know
What I was walling in or walling out,
And to whom I was like to give offense.
Something there is that doesn't love a wall,
That wants it down.\u2019 I could say \u2018Elves\u2019 to him,
But it's not elves exactly, and I'd rather
He said it for himself. I see him there
Bringing a stone grasped firmly by the top
In each hand, like an old-stone savage armed.
He moves in darkness as it seems to me,
Not of woods only and the shade of trees.
He will not go behind his father's saying,
And he likes having thought of it so well
He says again, \u2018Good fences make good neighbors.\u2019`.split(/\n/g).map(e=>e.trim()),KHh=0,rMr=class{constructor(t){this.isMuted=!1;this.handlingTokenExpiration=!1;this.decryptedUserMap={};this.averageRecentVoiceLevel={};this.volumeDataInterval=null;this.micStateInterval=null;this.streamingAudioForCaptions=!1;this._microphonePermissionDenied=!0;this.captionsToggleEnabled=!1;this.volumeLevelsStore=EGt({});this.activeSpeakerIdStore=EGt(null);this.recentlySpokeIdStore=EGt(null);this.setMicrophone=async t=>{var o,r;try{(o=this.unpublishedLocalAudioTrack)==null||o.setDevice(t.deviceId),await((r=this.localAudioTrack)==null?void 0:r.setDevice(t.deviceId)),this.microphone=t}catch(n){throw n}};this.setPlaybackDevice=async t=>{var o;try{(o=this.client)==null||o.remoteUsers.forEach(r=>{var n;return(n=r.audioTrack)==null?void 0:n.setPlaybackDevice(t.deviceId)}),this.playbackDevice=t}catch(r){throw r}};this.getMicrophones=t=>this.AgoraRTC.getMicrophones(t);this.getPlaybackDevices=t=>{var o;return(o=this.AgoraRTC)==null?void 0:o.getPlaybackDevices(t)};this.currentMicrophone=async()=>{var t;return this.microphone||((t=await this.getMicrophones())==null?void 0:t[0])};this.currentPlaybackDevice=async()=>{var t;return this.playbackDevice||((t=await this.getPlaybackDevices())==null?void 0:t[0])};this.getParticipantIds=async()=>{if(!this.client||!this.userId)throw new Error("Client not yet instantiated");let t=[];for(let o of this.client.remoteUsers){let r=await this.getDecryptedUserId(o.uid);r&&t.push(r)}return t.push(this.userId),t};this.startPollingMicState=()=>{dt&&(this.microphonePermissionDenied&&dt.setUsingMicrophone(!1),this.micStateInterval=setInterval(()=>{var t,o;this.client&&((t=dt)==null||t.setIsInVoiceCall(this.client.connectionState!=="DISCONNECTED"),(o=dt)==null||o.setUsingMicrophone(!!this.isPublishingLocalTrack()))},5e3))};this.stopPollingMicState=()=>{this.micStateInterval&&(clearInterval(this.micStateInterval),this.micStateInterval=null)};this.isPublishingLoca